{"2429600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Herdles", "steam_appid": 2429600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429600/extras/c0016e36c6af0752f9dd652432d7ddf6.poster.avif?t=1787702146\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429600/extras/c0016e36c6af0752f9dd652432d7ddf6.webm?t=1787702146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429600/extras/c0016e36c6af0752f9dd652432d7ddf6.mp4?t=1787702146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bark to save the world!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Herdles, you play a magical dog on a mission to save the world! Zoom through four regions of a vibrant landscape, using physics-based powers to venture further, solve puzzles and overcome challenges. Unleash your secret powers with the dedicated bark button! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429600/extras/ad108ee28a7efa694b46b1053186ebaf.poster.avif?t=1787702146\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429600/extras/ad108ee28a7efa694b46b1053186ebaf.webm?t=1787702146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429600/extras/ad108ee28a7efa694b46b1053186ebaf.mp4?t=1787702146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find creative solutions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you’ll save corrupted creatures called ‘Herdles’. Each Herdle comes with  new abilities – bounce, glide, break through walls, swim up waterfalls, and more. Playful experimentation is key both in the lush overworld and the ethereal dungeons of the Netherrealm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429600/extras/00cd400c089d13118f101abca59ee620.poster.avif?t=1787702146\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429600/extras/00cd400c089d13118f101abca59ee620.webm?t=1787702146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429600/extras/00cd400c089d13118f101abca59ee620.mp4?t=1787702146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No combat or death</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Herdles offers deep accessibility and customization options that you can tailor to suit your comfort, needs and playstyle. Em<strong><i>bark</i></strong> on an adorable adventure with no combat or death, just cozy, joyful fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429600/extras/d16de9cac4a5a3a6511a9d7225ad90cd.poster.avif?t=1787702146\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429600/extras/d16de9cac4a5a3a6511a9d7225ad90cd.webm?t=1787702146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429600/extras/d16de9cac4a5a3a6511a9d7225ad90cd.mp4?t=1787702146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Based on a true dog </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The canine hero of Herdles is inspired by creative director's Christian’s real-life dog, Snoopy :D</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An adorable dog hero inspired by the developer’s real life pet! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vibrant world and uncover ethereal dungeons in the Netherrealm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open up new paths and secret areas as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No combat, no death – just cozy fun!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dedicated bark button!! (of course)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles and challenges with creative, physics-based solutions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic platforming with a huge range of abilities!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep customization and accessibility!</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429600/extras/c0016e36c6af0752f9dd652432d7ddf6.poster.avif?t=1787702146\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429600/extras/c0016e36c6af0752f9dd652432d7ddf6.webm?t=1787702146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429600/extras/c0016e36c6af0752f9dd652432d7ddf6.mp4?t=1787702146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bark to save the world!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Herdles, you play a magical dog on a mission 